TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions, heat to 200C in 10 steps with calcite equilibrium
SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50 mmol/kgw
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 38 56 74 92 110 128 146 164 182 200
USER_PUNCH
    -headings density
    10 PUNCH RHO
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_heat.sel
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -pH true
    -si Calcite
    -user_punch true
END
